# RAG Engine From Scratch

A production-oriented Retrieval-Augmented Generation engine built incrementally from first principles.

## Goals

- Understand every component
- Build without high-level frameworks
- Benchmark architectural decisions
- Progress from a simple implementation to a production-ready retrieval system

## Roadmap

- [x] PDF ingestion
- [x] Chunking
- [x] Embeddings
- [x] Manual cosine similarity
- [ ] Qdrant vector database
- [ ] Metadata filtering
- [ ] Hybrid retrieval
- [ ] Reranking